<title>USA: Wainoco Oil makes offer for 12 pct notes.</title>
<headline>Wainoco Oil makes offer for 12 pct notes.</headline>
<dateline>HOUSTON 1997-07-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Wainoco Oil Corp said Monday it was making a tender offer for $91.4 million of its outstanding 12 percent senior notes due 2002 pursuant to bond indenture requirements pertaining to asset dispositions.</p>
<p>The company said the offer is being made at par plus accrued interest. It is scheduled to expire August 20.</p>
<p>On June 16, Wainoco said, it completed the sale of its Canadian oil and gas properties and received net proceeds of $91.4 million.</p>
<p>((--New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610))</p>
</text>
